  "description": "IROLAG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C270 H178 N2 O52 Y8,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Y1 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y2 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y3 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y4 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y5 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y6 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y7 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y8 (Y) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.699-3.821 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.56-109.39°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C135H95NO29Y4.",
